WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Step 1: In the sub-account you'll use, open Settings and scroll to Other Settings. Click Private Integrations.

2
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Step 2: Not in the list? GoHighLevel says to switch the feature on in Labs first.

3
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Step 3: Click Create new Integration.

4
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Step 4: Name it RevOps Workshop, add a short description, and click Next.

5
00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:39.000
Step 5: Pick only the card's scopes: contacts, tags, custom fields, opportunities, pipelines, locations and workflows.

6
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:46.000
Step 6: Click Copy. The token starts pit- and GoHighLevel won't show it again.

7
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:53.000
Step 7: Open Settings, then Business Profile. Copy the Location ID with the copy icon.
